diff --git a/.commit-msg b/.commit-msg
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..7860d40
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.commit-msg
@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+Add --threshold option to frai eval with exit code gating.
+
+Implement threshold validation for frai eval and SDK:
+- Add parseThresholds() and validateThresholds() to frai-core
+- generateReport() now accepts optional thresholds parameter
+- Threshold results (passed/failed) appear in JSON and Markdown reports
+- --threshold <metric>=<min> option can be used multiple times
+- Exit 1 if any threshold fails, 0 if all pass or no thresholds given
+- Exit 2 for usage errors (malformed threshold or unknown metric id)
+- Unknown metric error lists valid metric ids
+- Missing metric scores (score: null) fail their thresholds
+- Metrics without required data (e.g., exact_match without references) return score: null
+
+Added 8 new tests for threshold functionality; only pre-existing test failure remains.
+
+Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
